  "question": "Describe a car, motorbike or bicycle trip that you think would be interesting\nYou should say:\n• Where you want to go\n• Who you want to go with\n• How easy or difficult the trip would be\n• And explain why you think using a car, motorbike or bicycle for this trip would be interesting",
  "topic": "Describe a car, motorbike or bicycle trip that you think would be interesting",
  "audio": true,
  "transcript": "Today I would like to talk about a motorbike trip along the central coast of Vietnam, especially the Hai Van Pass between Da Nang and Hue city. Actually, I have dreamed about doing this trip for a long time, and I want to go there with my best friends from university. Speaking about the difficulty, I think the trip will be quite challenge because the mountain road has many sharp turns and steep hills, so we have to drive very careful. Also, the weather in central Vietnam can change quite fast with sudden rain. However, travelling by motorbike is much more interesting than sitting in a bus or a car because we can feel the fresh wind and enjoy the breathtaking scenery of the ocean and green mountains. Whenever we see a beautiful beach or local food stall, we can stop immediately to take photos and relax together. Overall, I think this journey will give us unforgettable memories and help us reduce stress after working hard.",
